{#- The trailing system message: the NPC cards' post-history instructions and
    the adaptive correctives, blank-line separated. Sent last, right before
    generation; omitted entirely when all are empty.
    Vars: npc_cards, voice_correction, length_correction (both str, possibly
    empty). The voice corrective goes FIRST of the two: length is a matter of
    trimming what was written, voice is a matter of who is writing it, so the
    identity correction has to land before the instruction to be brief. -#}
{%- set blocks = [] -%}
{%- for d in npc_cards -%}
{%- if d.get("post_history_instructions", "").strip() -%}{%- set _ = blocks.append(d.get("post_history_instructions", "").strip()) -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- if voice_correction.strip() -%}{%- set _ = blocks.append(voice_correction.strip()) -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if length_correction.strip() -%}{%- set _ = blocks.append(length_correction.strip()) -%}{%- endif -%}
{{ blocks | join("\n\n") }}
